→ Tencent → Hong Kong.\nBuilding AI products. \nHelping families earn their first USD.\n\n从银川到深圳，再到香港的三娃父亲。\n公众号：星佳是个小人物","raw_description":{"text":"Dad of 3. Yinchuan → Tencent → Hong Kong.\nBuilding AI products. \nHelping families earn their first USD.\n\n从银川到深圳，再到香港的三娃父亲。\n公众号：星佳是个小人物","facets":[]},"location":"People's Republic of China","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/199593931/1773080198","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2055617614169477120/_x5cbZXN_200x200.jpg","joined":"Thu Oct 07 08:02:46 +0000 2010","protected":false,"website":{"url":"http://ai.xingjia.xyz","display_url":"ai.xingjia.xyz"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":66,"retweets":632,"likes":3397,"bookmarks":5929,"quotes":49,"created_at":"Thu Oct 01 14:47:55 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790866075,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":661512,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":null,"replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"article":{"created_at":"2026-10-01T14:47:55.000Z","modified_at":"2026-10-01T14:47:55.000Z","id":"2105670932258000896","title":"存款不到 100 万的年轻人，请直接照做这张生存清单","preview_text":"前几天刷到一张 X 状态，标题很扎眼：\"存款不到100万请直接照做\"。\n我盯着那29条清单一条一条往下看，越看越觉得熟悉，这不就是我这几年折腾香港公司、开海外账户、跑通AI出海的路线图吗？","cover_media":{"id":"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHTjYohPa0AAKAAIAAAAAC+WPywAA","media_id":"2105671016425115648","media_info":{"__typename":"ApiImage","color_info":{"palette":[{"percentage":90.4,"rgb":{"blue":32,"green":20,"red":14}},{"percentage":4.23,"rgb":{"blue":32,"green":40,"red":53}},{"percentage":3.32,"rgb":{"blue":151,"green":157,"red":157}}]},"original_img_height":512,"original_img_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTjYohPa0AAFNj-.jpg","original_img_width":1280},"media_key":"3_2105671016425115648"},"content":{"blocks":[{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"as656","text":"前几天刷到一张 X 状态，标题很扎眼：\"存款不到100万请直接照做\"。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"d85h0","text":"我盯着那29条清单一条一条往下看，越看越觉得熟悉，这不就是我这几年折腾香港公司、开海外账户、跑通AI出海的路线图吗？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3ehis","text":"从注册美区ID到开盈透证券，从学Claude到做自己的小产品，每一条我几乎都踩过坑、花过冤枉钱、也拿到了结果。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"89mdq","text":"但光有清单不够。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4r6eo","text":"清单告诉你\"做什么\"，没告诉你\"为什么做\"和\"按什么顺序做\"。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"69cr9","text":"今天我把这张清单拆开，配上我自己踩过的坑，给你一个能直接上手的执行策略。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"55qrn","text":"一、先搞清楚：你到底在为什么焦虑","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cjmi4","text":"我以前总觉得，焦虑是因为钱不够多。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3g7mm","text":"直到我见过月薪五万还在焦虑的人，也见过收入不高但睡得特别香的人。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9lb8g","text":"后来才明白，焦虑的根源不是钱少，而是收入来源单一、抗风险能力为零、对未来没有掌控感。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"92qd4","text":"你每个月的工资到账，扣完房贷车贷生活费，剩下的全靠公司明年还愿不愿意给你发。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"36lfj","text":"公司裁员、行业下行、身体健康出问题，任何一个变量出问题，整个系统就崩了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6m0ck","text":"这不是你不够努力，这是结构上的脆弱。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8e9mr","text":"真正的安全感，不是银行卡里的数字，而是你有多少条腿在走路。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2ajaq","text":"所以这张清单的底层逻辑，不是教你怎么暴富，而是教你怎么从\"单腿站立\"变成\"多腿走路\"，从单一工资收入，变成工资+投资+个人品牌+产品收入的多元结构。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fvlod","text":"二、第一阶段：工具基建，30天搞定","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8vc69","text":"很多人一上来就想做个人IP、想做产品、想赚美元。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2nafb","text":"别着急，先把基础设施搭好。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9e6ko","text":"就像盖房子，你得先通水通电通路，才能开始砌砖。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dh3in","text":"这些工具看起来都是小事，但每一件都在拓宽你人生的边界，你能接触到的信息、你能调动的资源、你能参与的游戏，都不一样了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8cdma","text":"必做清单（按优先级排）：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8rin","text":"1. 设备：苹果手机非国行版本 + MacBook。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1ijm4","text":"不是崇洋媚外，是整个跨境生态对苹果最友好，美区ID、海外支付、AI工具，苹果生态是最顺的一条路。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"57ni9","text":"2. 账号：注册美区ID和香港ID，下载X（原Twitter）。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e88j6","text":"不是让你刷八卦，是让你直接看一手信息，AI圈的最新动态、海外创业者的讨论、英文世界的真实讨论，都在X上。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"57soa","text":"3. 通讯：一张香港手机卡和美国 esim 手机号。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6fp95","text":"这是你进入全球金融系统的钥匙，很多海外银行、券商的验证，内地手机号根本收不到。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dqh99","text":"4. 银行：香港众安银行卡","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":0,"text":"https://l.za.group/qV99a","toIndex":24}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f2op3","text":"https://l.za.group/qV99a  或","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9vcq","text":"starryblu 新加坡借记卡","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":0,"text":"https://sg.starryblu.com/x/NSFHxKQj","toIndex":35}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5a3rj","text":"https://sg.starryblu.com/x/NSFHxKQj","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bttpa","text":"+ 汇丰或者渣打银行卡「50 万达标全球理财」+ 美国 Amex 信用卡。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2r2hb","text":"有了香港账户，你才能自由兑换港币和美元，才能买全球的股票和基金。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ci9in","text":"5. 券商：盈透或者致富，嘉信等证券账户。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5n2qf","text":"这是个人投资者能开到的、全球投资品类最全的券商账户，美股、港股、ETF、期权，一个账户全搞定。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"80f0v","text":"6. AI工具：Claude、ChatGPT、Gemini、DeepSeek，至少深度用熟一个。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3q7v1","text":"不是让你聊天玩，是让它帮你写代码、做表格、写文案、查资料，把它当成你的24小时助理。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ddto1","text":"这一阶段的核心是：先拥有入场资格。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"22gnm","text":"很多人一辈子都在岸上看，从来没下过水。你花30天把这些搞定，就已经超过90%的人了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"brrl3","text":"三、第二阶段：能力建设，90天见效","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9l6s0","text":"工具有了，接下来练本事。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"beg4f","text":"这一阶段的目标只有一个：让你一个人就能干以前一个团队的活。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":0,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"27rg0","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6bh3p","text":"AI时代最大的红利，就是个人能力被指数级放大，一个会用工具的人，顶得上以前十个人。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7t0hh","text":"具体做什么：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2eiv3","text":"1. AI深度使用：学会用AI写作、做表格、做PPT、写代码和做视频。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7jgch","text":"不是\"知道有这个功能\"，是真的能用它产出工作成果。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cdvo5","text":"拿Codex写一个简单的工具出来，哪怕只是一个自动处理Excel的小脚本，比如像我写一本书去 kindle 卖。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f70ri","text":"或者在线免费阅读的小说：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":0,"text":"https://ai.xingjia.xyz/company","toIndex":30}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"99cn1","text":"https://ai.xingjia.xyz/company","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":1,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dhi5d","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c5kfb","text":"2. 编程入门：学会用GitHub，能看懂优秀项目。不用你成为算法工程师，但你得能看懂别人在做什么、能抄作业、能改一改自己用。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"76hio","text":"3. 英语捡起来：每天花1小时，坚持用英文搜索和阅读。不用背单词，就直接搜你感兴趣的东西，AI工具怎么用、海外怎么创业、美股怎么投。用着用着就会了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c6so4","text":"4. 知识库搭建：用Notion或Obsidian，最容易的就是付费的得到笔记 App  建一个自己的知识库。你看过的文章、踩过的坑、学到的经验，都分门别类存进去。这是你以后个人品牌和产品的原材料仓库。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1ia1v","text":"5. 信息源升级：每周读一份行业报告，把刷短视频的时间换成YouTube上的干货视频。一手信息和二手信息的差距，比你想象的大得多。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6uevi","text":"这一阶段的核心是：用工具放大你的产出能力。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8rm1v","text":"以前你一天只能干一件事，现在能干十件。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f45od","text":"效率提升10倍，你的收入天花板自然就抬高了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4v7s6","text":"四、第三阶段：","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"54g3m","text":"资产与现金流，长期主义","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bqn10","text":"能力有了，接下来是最关键的一步，把能力变成资产，把劳动收入变成现金流。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cn0bj","text":"这是大多数人一辈子都没跨过去的坎。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c9r83","text":"他们一直用时间换钱，从来没想过怎么让钱替自己干活、怎么让产品替自己干活。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bdpvg","text":"具体路径：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4uquo","text":"1. 指数基金定投：持续买入标普500和纳斯达克100。这是普通人能拿到的、风险收益比最好的投资品，没有之一。不用选股、不用择时，每个月工资到账先买一笔，买了就忘掉。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a9mrm","text":"2. 多元货币配置：建立美元资产意识，不要只了解人民币资产。港币、美元、人民币，至少持有三种货币的资产，对冲单一货币的风险。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"csedc","text":"3. 个人IP起步：运营一个X账号和一个国内自媒体账号，每天输出一篇内容，不管有没有人看，坚持一年。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9vvog","text":"这不是为了当网红，是为了建立你的个人供给，让别人知道你是谁、你能做什么、愿意为你付钱。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a5rjh","text":"4. 做一个自己的小产品：小网站、小工具、小课程都行。产品是睡后收入的载体——你做一次，它能卖无数次。不用追求完美，先做出来再说。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e0h6r","text":"比如星佳的付费产品","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":0,"text":"https://books.xingjia.xyz","toIndex":25}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ekujv","text":"https://books.xingjia.xyz","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ab46l","text":"5. 攒第一桶金：每个月存下收入的30%，学会记账，知道每一分钱花去了哪里。第一桶金不是用来花的，是用来生钱的本金。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8i66e","text":"这一阶段的核心是：从\"出卖时间\"转向\"拥有资产\"。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4kb5r","text":"资产的特点是，你睡觉的时候它还在帮你赚钱。当你的资产性收入超过工资收入的那一天，你就真正自由了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"an1p","text":"五、最后说几句掏心窝子的","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"18h8d","text":"我把这张清单和网友总结的\"八荣八耻\"放在一起看，发现说的其实是同一件事：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fevmn","text":"以指数纪律为荣，以奢侈品撑场面为耻；","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"49srl","text":"以跨境通行能力为荣，以一代人积蓄换学区信号为耻；","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c1bqg","text":"以个人供给可定价为荣，以职位代替能力为耻；","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eth3h","text":"以多元货币收入为荣，以单一工资裸奔为耻；","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bakak","text":"以掌握源头信息为荣，以二手观点代替求证为耻；","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cd25a","text":"以深度输入代替空转刷屏为荣，以拒绝新工具重复低效为耻；","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4gpqc","text":"以工具放大产出为荣，以负债满足虚荣为耻；","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b40ia","text":"以现金流、睡眠和可支配时间为荣，以透支身体换钱为耻。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7vtm7","text":"所有扰乱你情绪、消耗你、拖慢你的人和环境，都要斩立决。每天看一遍，绝对不能扰乱圣心。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9meqp","text":"这不是鸡汤，这是一个普通人在这个时代能拿到的最实在的生存策略。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dotao","text":"你不需要全部做到，从第一阶段的30天基建开始就行。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4fl1i","text":"买个美区ID、开个香港账户、装个Claude 或者 ChatGPT","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7ffe4","text":"这三件事，做完你会发现，世界好像比以前大了一圈。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3cibp","text":"如果你也在走这条路，或者准备开始走，评论区留个脚印，路上的人多了，就不孤单了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":2,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8hisc","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":3,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5npdr","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1fn0p","text":"","type":"unstyled"}],"entityMap":[{"key":"0","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"ea29bff7-fe06-4f6e-b80b-51212a92ab49","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"7","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2105671006350376960"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"1","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"cd708041-d470-4657-861b-88eccf643390","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"5","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2105670991200567296"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"2","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"b3db205d-5479-49ed-ab0a-e709e7ef1742","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"11","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2105671020514541568"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"3","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"9608fc9c-8e89-49d9-9892-0a53d9ac536c","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"6","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2105670997936611328"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}}]},"media_entities":[{"id":"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHTjYn7tagAAKAAIAAAAAC+WPywAA","media_id":"2105671006350376960","media_info":{"__typename":"ApiImage","color_info":{"palette":[{"percentage":95.63,"rgb":{"blue":20,"green":14,"red":11}},{"percentage":3.62,"rgb":{"blue":106,"green":108,"red":116}},{"percentage":0.74,"rgb":{"blue":67,"green":66,"red":80}}]},"original_img_height":675,"original_img_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTjYn7tagAA2UZS.jpg","original_img_width":1080},"media_key":"3_2105671006350376960"},{"id":"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHTjYnDRawAAKAAIAAAAAC+WPywAA","media_id":"2105670991200567296","media_info":{"__typename":"ApiImage","color_info":{"palette":[{"percentage":97.79,"rgb":{"blue":255,"green":255,"red":255}},{"percentage":0.98,"rgb":{"blue":71,"green":95,"red":159}},{"percentage":0.91,"rgb":{"blue":108,"green":125,"red":134}},{"percentage":0.2,"rgb":{"blue":193,"green":179,"red":231}},{"percentage":0.11,"rgb":{"blue":209,"green":197,"red":186}}]},"original_img_height":1848,"original_img_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTjYnDRawAA6u3s.jpg","original_img_w